WEBVTT

00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:04.380
Your cheek is as good as new!

00:00:04.380 --> 00:00:08.350
I heal fast. Injuries from 
a fall only take three days!

00:00:09.230 --> 00:00:11.100
You're a tough chick!

00:00:15.530 --> 00:00:18.650
The Countdown is almost here, huh?

00:00:18.650 --> 00:00:21.290
Yep. I'm looking forward to it.

00:00:21.290 --> 00:00:23.580
Whoa, I'm getting nervous!

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:25.560
Why would <i>you</i> be nervous?

00:00:25.560 --> 00:00:26.710
Good point.

00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:41.060
Hiyori-chan is so down these days.

00:00:41.060 --> 00:00:43.630
L-Listen, Hina...

00:00:43.630 --> 00:00:44.580
Hmm?

00:00:44.580 --> 00:00:47.890
Do you have any New Year's plans?

00:00:47.890 --> 00:00:51.070
Natsuki says she's got extra concert tickets...

00:00:51.420 --> 00:00:53.310
Hmm? Did you say something?

00:00:53.980 --> 00:00:56.160
Unbelievable...

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:09.460
<i>I'm charmed by how you go all-out</i>

00:01:09.460 --> 00:01:13.960
<i>I'm charmed by your supportive smile</i>

00:01:13.960 --> 00:01:18.340
<i>"I must kiss you," says your Romeo</i>

00:01:18.340 --> 00:01:22.310
<i>Glad that you exist and that he met you</i>

00:01:22.930 --> 00:01:26.540
<b>Heroines Run the Show</b>

00:01:30.190 --> 00:01:33.940
<i>I need more love, want to see you again soon</i>

00:01:33.940 --> 00:01:38.030
<i>Lock eyes with you and tell you</i>

00:01:38.030 --> 00:01:41.950
<i>My sincerest "Thank you for everything"</i>

00:01:41.950 --> 00:01:46.210
<i>Will you love me—
not as a fan, but for real?</i>

00:01:46.210 --> 00:01:49.250
<i>"Pick me"</i>

00:01:49.960 --> 00:01:52.960
<i>"No, pick me"</i>

00:01:53.900 --> 00:01:57.840
<i>Choose which kiss you want</i>

00:01:57.840 --> 00:02:01.030
<i>And let your Romeo bind you</i>

00:02:01.970 --> 00:02:05.470
<i>I'm charmed by how you go all-out</i>

00:02:05.470 --> 00:02:10.020
<i>I'm charmed watching you sing with me</i>

00:02:10.020 --> 00:02:13.340
<i>I'm even charmed by your tears</i>

00:02:13.340 --> 00:02:17.740
<i>I'm charmed by your supportive smile</i>

00:02:17.740 --> 00:02:21.370
<i>Thank you for coming to meet me</i>

00:02:21.370 --> 00:02:25.660
<i>Thank you for calling my name</i>

00:02:25.660 --> 00:02:30.210
<i>"I must kiss you," says your Romeo</i>

00:02:30.210 --> 00:02:34.400
<i>Glad that you exist and that he met you</i>

00:02:36.010 --> 00:02:38.260
<b>Go for it!!
Japan's No. 1 Idols!!
Their Journey So Far</b>

00:02:43.420 --> 00:02:45.270
Found you, Chizu!

00:02:45.670 --> 00:02:46.350
Why are you—

00:02:49.650 --> 00:02:54.780
You know, back in middle school, 
I used to eat alone a lot, too.

00:02:55.990 --> 00:03:01.240
Hanging out in groups isn't my thing, 
and I didn't mind being alone.

00:03:01.790 --> 00:03:02.910
But...

00:03:03.340 --> 00:03:07.490
Eating with you and Hiyori was pretty fun!

00:03:08.040 --> 00:03:10.290
Let's start eating together again.

00:03:10.290 --> 00:03:11.150
We can't.

00:03:11.640 --> 00:03:12.920
Why not?

00:03:12.920 --> 00:03:15.920
I set her up to get harassed 
by posting those photos.

00:03:17.220 --> 00:03:18.470
And I punched her.

00:03:19.170 --> 00:03:21.800
But you were worried about her, right?

00:03:22.600 --> 00:03:24.440
Enough to sob like a baby.

00:03:26.090 --> 00:03:27.680
It's too late, okay?!

00:03:31.310 --> 00:03:33.190
You forgot something!

00:03:34.730 --> 00:03:39.740
I had no idea you were their fan.

00:03:40.730 --> 00:03:43.400
I'm not going to be anymore.

00:03:43.980 --> 00:03:45.470
I don't have the right.

00:03:46.990 --> 00:03:49.330
I hear the fan support for you was amazing.

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:55.960
The Countdown sponsors apparently 
received a lot of requests for LIP×LIP!

00:03:56.310 --> 00:04:00.090
So many fans supported you 
during that media fuss, too.

00:04:00.090 --> 00:04:01.570
Something to be glad for.

00:04:01.570 --> 00:04:02.630
Yep.

00:04:03.020 --> 00:04:07.350
I got comp tickets. Give them to 
someone you'd like to come see you.

00:04:07.350 --> 00:04:09.900
I don't really have anyone.

00:04:10.250 --> 00:04:12.980
If our fans watch it, that's enough for me.

00:04:12.980 --> 00:04:16.940
Your fans aren't the only ones 
who supported you, are they?

00:04:17.610 --> 00:04:20.610
<b>December 20</b>

00:04:17.890 --> 00:04:20.610
Have a happy New Year, everyone.

00:04:20.610 --> 00:04:22.060
Akechi-sensei!

00:04:24.950 --> 00:04:27.370
Thank you for everything you did this year.

00:04:28.100 --> 00:04:30.660
We'd like to give you these tickets.

00:04:31.330 --> 00:04:33.400
I appreciate the thought.

00:04:33.930 --> 00:04:38.500
But I'm afraid it's not appropriate for 
a teacher to accept personal gifts.

00:04:39.100 --> 00:04:42.510
I'll be rooting for you, though. Break a leg.

00:04:42.510 --> 00:04:43.450
Yes, sir!

00:04:44.910 --> 00:04:45.950
<i>Break a leg!</i>

00:04:48.950 --> 00:04:50.420
Hiyori...

00:04:50.420 --> 00:04:52.410
What should we do with this?

00:04:52.410 --> 00:04:54.230
Huh? Isn't that—

00:04:54.230 --> 00:04:57.980
<b>Go for it!!
Japan's No. 1 Idols!!
Their Journey So Far</b>

00:04:54.230 --> 00:04:57.980
Chizuru's notebook. She said 
she didn't want it, but...

00:04:57.980 --> 00:05:02.230
Wait, this is Chutan-san's work!

00:05:05.150 --> 00:05:08.360
Did you two give Hiyoko a ticket?

00:05:08.850 --> 00:05:09.980
I didn't.

00:05:09.980 --> 00:05:11.120
Neither did I.

00:05:12.620 --> 00:05:14.060
Honestly!

00:05:14.060 --> 00:05:18.500
You need to talk about who will do it, 
or if you'll do it together, or what!

00:05:18.500 --> 00:05:21.450
I don't plan to give her one.

00:05:21.450 --> 00:05:24.010
Me either. She doesn't need one.

00:05:26.680 --> 00:05:29.380
<i>I first saw you in a Pockets commercial.</i>

00:05:30.760 --> 00:05:33.020
<i>The moment I laid eyes on you...</i>

00:05:33.730 --> 00:05:35.890
<i>There was a Big Bang inside of me.</i>

00:05:36.850 --> 00:05:41.250
<i>I was living in darkness, and you 
were the shining star that lit me up.</i>

00:05:41.900 --> 00:05:45.140
<i>When we ended up in the same 
class at the same high school,</i>

00:05:45.140 --> 00:05:47.150
<i>I was sure it was fate.</i>

00:05:47.910 --> 00:05:50.410
<i>Ever since, I've spent my days working 
for you, financially supporting you,</i>

00:05:50.410 --> 00:05:53.130
<i>then working more and buying more for you.</i>

00:05:53.670 --> 00:05:55.750
<i>It was all because I loved you.</i>

00:05:56.410 --> 00:05:59.580
<i>I vowed to give the rest of my life to you.</i>

00:06:00.470 --> 00:06:01.540
<i>But...</i>

00:06:02.530 --> 00:06:05.220
<i>Someone who causes you trouble 
doesn't deserve to be your fan.</i>

00:06:05.720 --> 00:06:07.550
<i>I have to end this.</i>

00:06:07.550 --> 00:06:09.800
Delete

00:06:07.550 --> 00:06:09.800
Move

00:06:07.550 --> 00:06:10.110
Copy

00:06:07.550 --> 00:06:10.110
Info

00:06:09.800 --> 00:06:09.930
Delete

00:06:09.800 --> 00:06:09.930
Move

00:06:09.930 --> 00:06:10.110
Delete

00:06:09.930 --> 00:06:10.110
Move

00:06:11.210 --> 00:06:13.740
<i>Goodbye, Aizo.</i>

00:06:16.700 --> 00:06:19.510
<i>I'm not sure I can go on living...</i>

00:06:24.180 --> 00:06:26.190
Hello, I'm visitin'!

00:06:26.570 --> 00:06:28.960
Huh? Wh-Why?

00:06:28.960 --> 00:06:32.730
I rang the doorbell, 
and your mom invited me in.

00:06:32.730 --> 00:06:36.200
Oh, I asked Akechi-sensei for your address.

00:06:36.200 --> 00:06:43.630
Anyway, this is amazin'! I can really 
feel your passion for LIP×LIP.

00:06:44.380 --> 00:06:47.490
It's none of your business. Why are you here?

00:06:48.990 --> 00:06:50.130
Here.

00:06:51.810 --> 00:06:52.910
I don't want them.

00:06:52.910 --> 00:06:57.430
Why not? Ya bought the ticket 
'cause ya wanted to go, right?

00:06:57.430 --> 00:06:59.620
So ya <i>gotta</i> go!

00:07:00.110 --> 00:07:01.270
What's your deal?

00:07:02.150 --> 00:07:07.150
What right do <i>you</i> have to order 
me to go to the concert?!

00:07:07.610 --> 00:07:11.700
It's none of your business 
whether I go or not!

00:07:11.700 --> 00:07:14.950
M-Maybe not, but...

00:07:15.470 --> 00:07:18.580
I'm not going to be a LIP×LIP fan anymore.

00:07:18.580 --> 00:07:19.830
What?

00:07:20.510 --> 00:07:22.020
Just leave me alone!

00:07:22.020 --> 00:07:22.730
Chizu-chan?

00:07:22.730 --> 00:07:24.050
Don't come back!

00:07:33.970 --> 00:07:34.930
What's that?

00:07:34.930 --> 00:07:36.840
Tickets to the Countdown.

00:07:37.730 --> 00:07:39.820
Might as well take 
someone there, if you're free.

00:07:39.820 --> 00:07:42.510
I thought we were pretending to be strangers?

00:07:42.510 --> 00:07:43.980
Yeah, at school.

00:07:43.980 --> 00:07:47.590
But if you really like someone... it's fine.

00:07:52.220 --> 00:07:53.490
Thanks.

00:07:53.880 --> 00:07:55.600
I'll try inviting Arisa-chan.

00:07:55.600 --> 00:07:59.210
I've been wanting to tell her loud 
and proud that you're my brother,

00:07:59.210 --> 00:08:01.170
since she's the woman I want to marry.

00:08:01.770 --> 00:08:02.740
I see.

00:08:03.560 --> 00:08:04.570
Koichiro.

00:08:05.500 --> 00:08:06.890
For you.

00:08:08.930 --> 00:08:11.130
I'll go if I have time.

00:08:11.730 --> 00:08:15.510
Did you give that manager-in-training 
girl a ticket?

00:08:15.510 --> 00:08:16.140
No.

00:08:16.430 --> 00:08:20.660
Do you understand how 
difficult these are to get?

00:08:21.180 --> 00:08:23.640
It was hard to even get the 
reservation site to load,

00:08:23.640 --> 00:08:25.770
and when it finally did, 
they immediately sold out.

00:08:26.280 --> 00:08:29.950
No one can go unless you give them 
a ticket, even if they want to!

00:08:29.950 --> 00:08:32.780
Wow, so you did want to.

00:08:33.970 --> 00:08:35.590
You wish!

00:08:35.590 --> 00:08:39.240
I'm just advising you to be more 
thoughtful and considerate!

00:08:39.900 --> 00:08:41.470
I'll take that to heart.

00:08:46.230 --> 00:08:49.670
I guess they're enterin' the 
venue right about now.

00:08:49.670 --> 00:08:51.550
<b>Go for it!!
Japan's No. 1 Idols!!
Their Journey So Far</b>

00:08:57.800 --> 00:08:59.230
Uchida-san!

00:09:00.280 --> 00:09:02.470
Don't ya have concert duty?

00:09:02.470 --> 00:09:07.020
The boys are already at the venue. 
I needed to give you this.

00:09:07.020 --> 00:09:08.400
It's...

00:09:08.650 --> 00:09:13.530
I thought we should give you a ticket, 
but they told me otherwise.

00:09:13.530 --> 00:09:16.030
"Obviously she should get 
this instead," they said.

00:09:17.410 --> 00:09:20.920
You prepared for this day along with us.

00:09:21.750 --> 00:09:24.540
Will you help out for just one more day?

00:09:30.030 --> 00:09:32.880
Uchida-san, please go on ahead.

00:09:32.880 --> 00:09:37.430
I'll be there once I do an important 
task as manager-in-trainin'.

00:09:37.430 --> 00:09:39.930
<b>LIP×LIP Countdown Live</b>

00:09:45.330 --> 00:09:47.190
Chizu-chan, let's go to the concert!

00:09:47.190 --> 00:09:49.310
You again? Why?!

00:09:49.310 --> 00:09:52.220
Your mom said to come right in.

00:09:52.220 --> 00:09:53.610
Dang it, Mom!

00:09:53.610 --> 00:09:56.820
She said she was happy 
ya had a friend visitin'.

00:09:57.230 --> 00:09:59.030
We're not friends!

00:09:59.030 --> 00:10:01.410
There's still time. Let's go!

00:10:01.720 --> 00:10:03.540
I told you, I won't go!

00:10:03.540 --> 00:10:07.320
If ya don't go, I know you'll 
regret it, Chizu-chan.

00:10:07.320 --> 00:10:09.790
No... Chutan!

00:10:11.640 --> 00:10:15.940
Ya sent LIP×LIP letters 
and presents all the time.

00:10:15.940 --> 00:10:18.970
Ya even wrote letters 
of support to the staff.

00:10:18.970 --> 00:10:22.680
Ya sent flowers for every 
event, even the tiny ones.

00:10:23.140 --> 00:10:24.930
How do you know that?

00:10:24.930 --> 00:10:28.440
Well, ya see...

00:10:29.230 --> 00:10:33.940
That's an all-area pass 
to the Countdown! How...

00:10:33.940 --> 00:10:36.500
Because I'm LIP×LIP staff.

00:10:36.500 --> 00:10:38.060
Staff?!

00:10:38.060 --> 00:10:43.080
My part-time job was actually as 
LIP×LIP's manager-in-trainin'.

00:10:44.210 --> 00:10:47.140
I was lookin' for a job to 
support my livin' expenses.

00:10:47.140 --> 00:10:50.440
The one I finally got happened to be that one.

00:10:50.440 --> 00:10:54.830
I sorted all of the fan mail, 
so I learned your name.

00:10:55.550 --> 00:11:00.260
I know exactly how passionately 
Chutan was supportin' LIP×LIP.

00:10:55.880 --> 00:10:56.960
<b>Chutan</b>

00:10:58.170 --> 00:10:59.380
I look forward
 to the concert!
 -Chutan

00:11:00.260 --> 00:11:01.340
<b>From Chutan</b>

00:11:01.340 --> 00:11:05.010
And so do Someya-kun 
and Shibasaki-kun, of course!

00:11:06.490 --> 00:11:07.600
Aizo knows?

00:11:07.600 --> 00:11:13.360
They both brought letters and presents home! 
They seemed happy about 'em.

00:11:18.810 --> 00:11:21.810
Why'd ya hide that you were a fan?

00:11:21.810 --> 00:11:26.930
Fans don't interfere in idols' private lives!

00:11:27.650 --> 00:11:32.020
Whether we want to get close or not, we keep
 a respectful distance and just watch!

00:11:32.020 --> 00:11:36.130
Otherwise, they'd get exhausted!

00:11:36.620 --> 00:11:42.530
You care about LIP×LIP a lot, 
don't ya? I can really feel your love.

00:11:43.430 --> 00:11:45.260
That means ya gotta watch the concert!

00:11:45.260 --> 00:11:49.010
But... I caused them trouble!

00:11:49.010 --> 00:11:51.330
The media hounded them because of my photos!

00:11:51.330 --> 00:11:53.140
They got over it.

00:11:54.520 --> 00:11:58.020
I came to tell ya this as 
the manager-in-trainin':

00:11:58.660 --> 00:12:01.780
They went all-out preparin' for today.

00:12:01.780 --> 00:12:04.970
So go to the concert and support them!

00:12:05.560 --> 00:12:06.660
Please!

00:12:12.680 --> 00:12:16.060
I'm sorry I punched you in the face.

00:12:16.060 --> 00:12:19.920
<i>I'm</i> sorry I kept my job a secret.

00:12:20.240 --> 00:12:23.050
I signed a contract sayin' 
I wouldn't tell anybody.

00:12:23.480 --> 00:12:28.620
If the management made that decision, 
it was for LIP×LIP's sake. It's fine.

00:12:28.620 --> 00:12:31.030
LIP×LIP is amazin', huh?

00:12:30.310 --> 00:12:32.810
<b>Countdown Live Venue</b>

00:12:31.030 --> 00:12:34.350
I didn't know a thing about idols before,

00:12:34.350 --> 00:12:37.810
but watchin' them kinda 
made every day bright.

00:12:38.180 --> 00:12:41.490
Yeah. My life changed!

00:12:41.900 --> 00:12:43.740
Think we're a little alike?

00:12:43.740 --> 00:12:47.590
Not at all. And I never 
interact with other fans.

00:12:47.590 --> 00:12:49.640
Huh?!

00:12:50.060 --> 00:12:53.460
But... we feel the same support for them.

00:12:53.830 --> 00:12:54.870
Yeah!

00:12:57.460 --> 00:13:01.300
Welcome to the Best Artist Countdown Live!

00:13:01.300 --> 00:13:04.470
We're your hosts, FT4!

00:13:04.470 --> 00:13:07.720
You've got energy today! 
Not as good as mine, of course.

00:13:08.140 --> 00:13:12.850
Get ready to enjoy performances by 
all the artists who made the cut!

00:13:13.420 --> 00:13:15.940
Let's all let loose together!

00:13:20.270 --> 00:13:22.180
You're finally here?

00:13:22.180 --> 00:13:25.850
"Never be late" is Manager 101.

00:13:25.850 --> 00:13:26.900
I'm sorry!

00:13:28.760 --> 00:13:31.730
I brought a LIP×LIP fan with me!

00:13:31.730 --> 00:13:36.480
She'd decided not to come, 
but I convinced her she had to.

00:13:36.480 --> 00:13:40.000
So make sure you give her a good time!

00:13:40.360 --> 00:13:41.350
On it!

00:13:40.360 --> 00:13:41.350
We will!

00:13:46.270 --> 00:13:49.150
They're calling for us.

00:13:49.150 --> 00:13:50.890
It feels good to be called for.

00:13:51.280 --> 00:13:54.540
They couldn't send us letters 
and presents over and over

00:13:54.540 --> 00:13:56.770
if they didn't love us, huh?

00:13:57.150 --> 00:14:01.590
They put themselves second to 
support us with all they have.

00:14:03.960 --> 00:14:06.780
Fans are cute, huh?

00:14:08.920 --> 00:14:13.340
I've never heard that word 
come out of your mouth before!

00:14:13.650 --> 00:14:16.290
Well, it's the word that came to mind.

00:14:17.100 --> 00:14:18.570
I agree with you.

00:14:22.350 --> 00:14:24.880
They give us their love.

00:14:24.880 --> 00:14:27.290
They support what we love.

00:14:27.890 --> 00:14:30.050
They're our Julietas...

00:14:30.050 --> 00:14:31.180
...and we love them.

00:14:38.180 --> 00:14:41.260
<i>Passion is unbeatable</i>

00:14:41.260 --> 00:14:44.280
<i>Live every moment of your youth</i>

00:14:44.280 --> 00:14:47.110
<i>Make a fool of yourself, cry, and learn</i>

00:14:47.110 --> 00:14:50.790
<i>Blow away all of your ri-ri-rivals</i>

00:15:01.630 --> 00:15:04.610
<i>Whatever you commit your whole self to</i>

00:15:04.610 --> 00:15:07.800
<i>Whatever makes you passionate</i>

00:15:07.800 --> 00:15:13.390
<i>Whoa, just go all-in on one feeling</i>

00:15:13.390 --> 00:15:16.260
<i>That misery when it doesn't work out</i>

00:15:16.260 --> 00:15:19.590
<i>That feeling when your heart is crushed</i>

00:15:19.590 --> 00:15:25.010
<i>Whoa, can't experience those things
if you don't go all-in</i>

00:15:25.010 --> 00:15:25.570
<i>Ride on</i>

00:15:25.570 --> 00:15:28.210
<i>Even lost love gives your life some spice</i>

00:15:28.210 --> 00:15:30.830
<i>We'll all fail, gotta
give each other smiles</i>

00:15:30.830 --> 00:15:33.870
<i>Shout when you're happy,
go ahead, be dramatic</i>

00:15:33.870 --> 00:15:36.870
<i>We're right in the middle here</i>

00:15:35.280 --> 00:15:36.870
They've changed.

00:15:36.870 --> 00:15:39.690
<i>Passion is unbeatable</i>

00:15:36.870 --> 00:15:42.410
Yeah. Before, it felt like they only 
thought about getting to the top.

00:15:39.690 --> 00:15:42.410
<i>Live every moment of your youth</i>

00:15:42.410 --> 00:15:45.520
<i>Make a fool of yourself, cry, and learn</i>

00:15:43.130 --> 00:15:46.500
Today, they're truly 
performing for their fans.

00:15:45.520 --> 00:15:48.200
<i>Blow away all of your ri-ri-rivals</i>

00:15:47.130 --> 00:15:50.130
The fans' smiles prove it.

00:15:48.200 --> 00:15:50.130
<i>Passion is—</i>

00:15:50.610 --> 00:15:56.220
<i>Show me what you're like
when you get serious</i>

00:15:56.220 --> 00:16:01.270
<i>You're a flower of youth
that never withers</i>

00:16:01.510 --> 00:16:06.610
<i>I can hear your heart pounding strong</i>

00:16:07.430 --> 00:16:12.950
<i>I can sense your feelings so pure</i>

00:16:14.610 --> 00:16:17.690
<i>Passion is unbeatable</i>

00:16:17.690 --> 00:16:20.500
<i>Live every moment of your youth</i>

00:16:20.500 --> 00:16:23.540
<i>Make a fool of yourself, cry, learn</i>

00:16:23.540 --> 00:16:26.430
<i>And blow away all of your ri-ri-rivals</i>

00:16:26.430 --> 00:16:29.380
<i>Passion is unbeatable</i>

00:16:29.380 --> 00:16:32.120
<i>Let them say what they want</i>

00:16:32.120 --> 00:16:35.220
<i>Grit your teeth, endure, learn</i>

00:16:35.220 --> 00:16:37.970
<i>And better yourself and your ri-ri-rivals</i>

00:16:37.970 --> 00:16:41.510
<i>Shine bright enough to dazzle our eyes</i>

00:17:10.340 --> 00:17:11.200
Good work.

00:17:11.200 --> 00:17:11.660
Nice job.

00:17:11.660 --> 00:17:12.840
Nice work.

00:17:13.160 --> 00:17:14.510
I felt the love.

00:17:14.820 --> 00:17:16.710
That was a good performance.

00:17:19.250 --> 00:17:21.060
Thank you!

00:17:22.810 --> 00:17:24.450
Why are you crying?

00:17:24.450 --> 00:17:27.660
Because I'm <i>moved</i>, obviously!

00:17:27.660 --> 00:17:29.120
Here, your nose is running.

00:17:29.120 --> 00:17:30.200
Thank you...

00:17:31.540 --> 00:17:34.030
Full Throttle4's performance has started.

00:17:34.030 --> 00:17:35.930
That cheering is insane.

00:17:35.930 --> 00:17:37.700
The walls are shaking.

00:17:37.970 --> 00:17:41.770
And you'll get there, too. Right?

00:17:42.330 --> 00:17:43.380
Yes, ma'am!

00:17:44.500 --> 00:17:49.460
Shibasaki-kun, Someya-kun! 
You were really, really great!

00:17:49.710 --> 00:17:53.370
The fans enjoyed it so much. 
Some girls were crying!

00:17:53.370 --> 00:17:55.470
It was the best!

00:17:55.470 --> 00:17:56.910
You, too.

00:17:56.910 --> 00:17:57.720
Huh?

00:17:58.410 --> 00:18:00.520
You brought one of our fans here, right?

00:18:00.520 --> 00:18:03.220
You've proven your worth, huh?

00:18:04.510 --> 00:18:05.700
Hiyori-chan...

00:18:06.730 --> 00:18:10.600
I think LIP×LIP will need you.

00:18:11.190 --> 00:18:15.490
Want to continue as manager-in-training, 
and work toward becoming a full manager?

00:18:17.720 --> 00:18:18.860
Yes, ma'am!

00:18:20.170 --> 00:18:25.320
To our fans, and all the other 
groups' fans—thanks for your support!

00:18:25.320 --> 00:18:27.750
We love you! Yay!

00:18:28.140 --> 00:18:33.250
We're going to kick things into even 
higher gear next year, so cheer us on!

00:18:33.250 --> 00:18:37.300
Here we go: the countdown to next year!

00:18:37.800 --> 00:18:39.110
Ten seconds!

00:18:39.660 --> 00:18:40.640
Nine!

00:18:40.640 --> 00:18:41.660
Eight!

00:18:41.660 --> 00:18:42.640
Seven!

00:18:42.640 --> 00:18:43.640
Six!

00:18:43.640 --> 00:18:44.640
Five!

00:18:44.640 --> 00:18:45.640
Four!

00:18:45.640 --> 00:18:46.640
Three!

00:18:46.870 --> 00:18:47.640
Two!

00:18:47.910 --> 00:18:48.640
One!

00:18:49.730 --> 00:18:53.500
<i>All right, our high school life has begun!</i>

00:18:50.150 --> 00:18:52.310
<i>I'm runnin', as always.</i>

00:18:52.810 --> 00:18:54.830
<i>Dashin' around every day.</i>

00:18:53.500 --> 00:18:57.070
<i>Will it have a happy ending?</i>

00:18:55.570 --> 00:18:58.360
<i>And those two are busy with work and school.</i>

00:18:57.070 --> 00:19:00.990
<i>Maybe we'll get boyfriends!?</i>

00:18:58.950 --> 00:19:02.950
<i>The support from Chizu-chan, 
a.k.a. Chutan, has heated up even more.</i>

00:19:00.990 --> 00:19:05.210
<i>Revel in high school girl life! Party!</i>

00:19:02.950 --> 00:19:07.830
<i>She checks out everything LIP×LIP 
does and gives me her comments.</i>

00:19:08.240 --> 00:19:10.200
<i>Hearing from fans is important!</i>

00:19:10.200 --> 00:19:11.580
You know...

00:19:11.580 --> 00:19:16.710
I get this question a lot in fan letters. 
"What type of girl do you like?"

00:19:12.250 --> 00:19:15.930
<i>I'm hopeless at studying for tests</i>

00:19:15.930 --> 00:19:19.500
<i>We'll never use differential 
or integral calculus anyway</i>

00:19:17.700 --> 00:19:22.970
They ask me those questions, too.
 "Do you have a girlfriend?"

00:19:19.790 --> 00:19:23.500
<i>My all-night cramming attack'll let me pass!</i>

00:19:22.970 --> 00:19:24.710
But they're ridiculous questions.

00:19:23.500 --> 00:19:27.220
<i>Get through it with a smile! 
We're three cheerful girls</i>

00:19:24.730 --> 00:19:25.990
Totally.

00:19:25.990 --> 00:19:27.220
Because we already have...

00:19:27.220 --> 00:19:30.550
<i>Our reward is sweets</i>

00:19:28.130 --> 00:19:29.480
...our Julietas.

00:19:31.100 --> 00:19:34.280
<i>I want to go to a concert, too</i>

00:19:32.540 --> 00:19:33.640
Chizu-chan?!

00:19:33.640 --> 00:19:36.610
I'm so glad I'm alive!

00:19:34.820 --> 00:19:40.030
<i>Have a sleepover and talk about crushes</i>

00:19:37.670 --> 00:19:42.110
<i>They got a lot of lovingly sent 
chocolates on Valentine's Day.</i>

00:19:40.370 --> 00:19:42.610
<i>No keeping secrets, got it?</i>

00:19:42.610 --> 00:19:47.370
<i>Shibasaki-kun still seems a little 
uncomfortable around girls, though.</i>

00:19:44.110 --> 00:19:47.900
<i>No time to hesitate—
the goal is high school heroine!</i>

00:19:47.900 --> 00:19:51.120
<i>Don't wanna play bit parts</i>

00:19:48.410 --> 00:19:52.110
<i>Oh, right! I had an amazin' 
"first meeting" a while ago!</i>

00:19:51.570 --> 00:19:55.430
<i>Follow your passions, no regrets</i>

00:19:52.110 --> 00:19:54.760
<i>Get this: Mona-chan is an idol, too!</i>

00:19:55.430 --> 00:19:58.550
<i>Going without is a waste</i>

00:19:55.960 --> 00:20:00.840
<i>The boys still fight, and they still 
haven't exchanged phone numbers.</i>

00:19:59.150 --> 00:20:02.910
<i>Stay on the edge of your seats, 
because we're gonna do big things</i>

00:20:01.490 --> 00:20:03.770
<i>So I'm the messenger!</i>

00:20:02.910 --> 00:20:06.140
<i>Don't wanna be model students</i>

00:20:03.770 --> 00:20:08.850
<i>At first I just repeated what they said, 
but these days I do some personal editin'!</i>

00:20:06.700 --> 00:20:10.410
<i>We'll say what we want, do what we want</i>

00:20:08.850 --> 00:20:10.730
<b>
Sorry about that
(is what Someya-kun is thinking)</b>

00:20:08.850 --> 00:20:13.100
I convert messages to, "Sorry about that,"
 or, "It's okay, I'm not mad,"

00:20:10.410 --> 00:20:13.890
<i>We're not gonna go without</i>

00:20:10.730 --> 00:20:13.100
<b>\hIt's okay, I'm not mad
(is what Shibasaki-kun is thinking)</b>

00:20:13.320 --> 00:20:15.740
<i>so that they can get over stuff faster.</i>

00:20:14.130 --> 00:20:18.520
<i>Revel in high school girl life! Party!</i>

00:20:16.430 --> 00:20:18.520
<i>I'm gettin' manager-like!</i>

00:20:19.860 --> 00:20:22.020
Everyone line up here, please!

00:20:22.020 --> 00:20:23.610
Hey, manager.

00:20:23.910 --> 00:20:27.580
Hmm? Does "manager" mean... me?

00:20:28.140 --> 00:20:30.010
Do you see anyone else here?

00:20:30.440 --> 00:20:32.100
We have a request.

00:20:32.550 --> 00:20:35.580
It's something we can only 
ask our manager to do.

00:20:36.260 --> 00:20:37.750
I'd be happy to!

00:20:42.470 --> 00:20:45.840
<i>Pleased to meet you, fair lady,
I've come from a western land</i>

00:20:45.840 --> 00:20:49.100
<i>To meet you, to love you,
and to win your hand</i>

00:20:49.370 --> 00:20:52.920
<i>Don't be alarmed,
I know this is sudden</i>

00:20:49.720 --> 00:20:54.350
<i>"Fill in for Panmy," they 
say... but what do I <i>do</i>?</i>

00:20:52.920 --> 00:20:56.260
<i>Please be my princess,
and let me be your husband</i>

00:20:56.260 --> 00:20:57.930
Thank you for coming today!

00:20:57.930 --> 00:20:59.860
And now we have a surprise for you!

00:21:00.830 --> 00:21:03.920
Some backup dancers... Panmy and Kumamaru!

00:21:03.920 --> 00:21:05.610
<i>Backup dancers?!</i>

00:21:06.150 --> 00:21:09.980
<i>Now this is just unreasonable!</i>

00:21:09.980 --> 00:21:13.340
<i>Ah, fair lady, do you
fret over what to do?</i>

00:21:13.340 --> 00:21:17.000
<i>I have a proposal, for
that frown doesn't suit you</i>

00:21:17.000 --> 00:21:20.130
<i>If it suits your fancy, then
please come away with me</i>

00:21:20.130 --> 00:21:23.760
<i>Let us leave it all behind,
and run away to the east</i>

00:21:23.760 --> 00:21:26.260
<i>Okay, I just gotta do it!</i>

00:21:23.760 --> 00:21:30.640
<i>Your rosy lips seem lonely,
that much I can tell</i>

00:21:30.640 --> 00:21:36.890
<i>Let me cast upon them
a tender spell</i>

00:21:33.950 --> 00:21:35.590
How good is that panda?!

00:21:35.590 --> 00:21:36.890
It's got <i>moves</i>!

00:21:36.890 --> 00:21:39.270
<i>And now, go put on a dress</i>

00:21:37.520 --> 00:21:40.270
<i>I'm not sure where my finish line is.</i>

00:21:39.270 --> 00:21:44.340
<i>May I have this dance with
the world's best princess?</i>

00:21:40.270 --> 00:21:43.280
<i>But let's live today together 
with all we've got!</i>

00:21:44.340 --> 00:21:45.920
<i>Everyone wants you</i>

00:21:44.340 --> 00:21:46.280
<i>I'm so dizzy...</i>

00:21:45.920 --> 00:21:47.660
<i>And that drives us wild</i>

00:21:47.660 --> 00:21:50.800
<i>I'm going to steal true love's kiss</i>

00:21:49.450 --> 00:21:51.200
<i>Huh? What?</i>

00:21:50.800 --> 00:21:58.040
<i>I have a gift, so close your eyes
as I pluck us a star right out of the sky</i>

00:21:53.790 --> 00:21:54.330
Whoa!

00:21:55.230 --> 00:22:00.080
<i>Is this fan service or bullying?! Or...</i>

00:21:58.040 --> 00:22:00.080
<i>All the world wants you</i>

00:21:59.800 --> 00:22:01.320
<i>It makes us play to win</i>

00:22:01.130 --> 00:22:04.460
<i>I don't even know!</i>

00:22:01.320 --> 00:22:04.460
<i>Your name is "Julieta"</i>

00:22:04.460 --> 00:22:09.970
<b>Final Episode</b>

00:22:04.460 --> 00:22:09.970
<b>Passion Is Unbeatable!</b>

00:22:10.370 --> 00:22:13.300
<i>Heroines are pretty girls</i>

00:22:13.300 --> 00:22:16.480
<i>who get fawned over by princes, right?</i>

00:22:16.480 --> 00:22:21.860
<i>Sometimes I wish a potato face like me
could be a princess, too (yeah!)</i>

00:22:32.410 --> 00:22:37.580
<i>I look for jobs, but no dice</i>

00:22:37.580 --> 00:22:40.350
<i>I get desperate and jump in</i>

00:22:40.350 --> 00:22:43.000
<i>To a world I'm too out of place in</i>

00:22:43.000 --> 00:22:48.200
<i>I'm a gofer, just running errands</i>

00:22:48.200 --> 00:22:53.720
<i>I got a position managing the worst people</i>

00:22:53.720 --> 00:22:58.650
<i>If they find out, I'm toast</i>

00:22:58.650 --> 00:23:03.610
<i>I don't want people's jealousy,
and I'm doing this to live (`･ω･´)9</i>

00:23:03.610 --> 00:23:06.510
<i>Heroines are pretty girls</i>

00:23:06.510 --> 00:23:09.610
<i>who get fawned over by princes, right?</i>

00:23:09.610 --> 00:23:15.000
<i>Sometimes I wish a potato face like me
could be a princess, too</i>

00:23:15.000 --> 00:23:17.190
<i>Be my producer</i>

00:23:17.190 --> 00:23:20.370
<i>Make my hair and my clothes cute</i>

00:23:20.370 --> 00:23:25.670
<i>O Lord, where's my future prince,
and what's he up to?</i>

00:23:25.670 --> 00:23:29.080
<i>I'll wait patiently for him (sigh...)</i>
